---
layout: layouts/game.njk
title: Breakout
description: Break all the bricks by bouncing the ball with your paddle.
category: arcade
icon: "🧱"
---

<style>
  #game-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .canvas-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    touch-action: none;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  canvas {
    border: 2px solid #7c2d12;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: none;
    display: block;
  }
  #overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    border-radius: 4px;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  #overlay h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: white;
  }
  .score-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .stat {
    text-align: center;
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .stat-value {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  .play-btn {
    padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    background: #ea580c;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .play-btn:hover {
    background: #c2410c;
  }
  .controls-hint {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748b;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .lives {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .life {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .demo-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #ea580c;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .info-section {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    padding: 0 1rem 2rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .info-details {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .info-details summary {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .info-details summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .info-details summary::after {
    content: "+";
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .info-details[open] summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }
  .info-body {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem 1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    border-top: 1px solid #334155;
  }
  .info-body h4 {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .info-body h4:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .info-body ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }
  .info-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .info-body p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }
</style>

<div id="game-wrapper">
  <div class="score-row">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-label">Score</div>
      <div class="stat-value" id="score">0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-label">Best</div>
      <div class="stat-value" id="best-score">0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-label">Lives</div>
      <div class="stat-value lives" id="lives">
        <span class="life">❤️</span><span class="life">❤️</span><span class="life">❤️</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-label">Level</div>
      <div class="stat-value" id="level">1</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="canvas-wrapper">
    <canvas id="breakout"></canvas>
    <div id="overlay">
      <span class="demo-label" id="demo-label">Live Demo</span>
      <span style="font-size: 3rem">🧱</span>
      <h2 id="overlay-title">Breakout</h2>
      <p id="overlay-msg" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center">
        Mouse, drag, or hold ← → to move paddle
      </p>
      <button class="play-btn" onclick="startGame()">Play Game</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="controls-hint">Mouse / finger drag · Hold ← → arrow keys</p>
</div>

<div class="info-section">
  <details class="info-details">
    <summary>How to Play</summary>
    <div class="info-body">
      <h4>Goal</h4>
      <p>Bounce the ball with your paddle to break all the bricks. Clear all 5 levels to win!</p>
      <h4>Controls</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Mouse</strong> — move cursor over canvas to position paddle (desktop)</li>
        <li><strong>Finger drag</strong> — drag left/right on the canvas (mobile)</li>
        <li><strong>Hold ← →</strong> — hold arrow keys for continuous paddle movement</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>Levels</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>5 levels total — ball speeds up each level</li>
        <li>Level 1 starts slow and manageable</li>
        <li>Top rows (pink/orange) take <strong>2 hits</strong> to break</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>Scoring</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Each brick = <strong>10 × level</strong> points</li>
        <li>3 lives — ball resets when it falls</li>
        <li>Best score saved in your browser</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="info-details">
    <summary>FAQ</summary>
    <div class="info-body">
      <h4>Why does the ball angle change when hitting the paddle?</h4>
      <p>
        The ball reflects based on where it hits the paddle — hitting the edge sends it at a sharp angle, hitting the
        centre bounces it straight up.
      </p>
      <h4>Do bricks reset when I lose a life?</h4>
      <p>No — your brick progress is saved between lives. Only the ball and paddle reset position.</p>
      <h4>Is my best score saved?</h4>
      <p>Yes — automatically saved in your browser's local storage.</p>
      <h4>Can I play on mobile?</h4>
      <p>Yes! The game scales to fit your screen. Drag your finger across the canvas to move the paddle.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<script>
  const canvas = document.getElementById("breakout");
  const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");
  const STORAGE_KEY = "mini-breakout-best";

  // Responsive: scale canvas to fit viewport
  const SIZE = Math.min(480, window.innerWidth - 32);
  canvas.width = SIZE;
  canvas.height = SIZE;
  const W = canvas.width,
    H = canvas.height;
  const S = SIZE / 480;

  const PADDLE_W = Math.round(80 * S);
  const PADDLE_H = Math.round(10 * S);
  const BALL_R = Math.max(5, Math.round(7 * S));
  const BRICK_ROWS = 5,
    BRICK_COLS = 10;
  const BRICK_H = Math.round(16 * S);
  const BRICK_GAP = Math.max(2, Math.round(4 * S));
  const BRICK_W = (W - BRICK_GAP) / BRICK_COLS - BRICK_GAP;
  const BRICK_TOP = Math.round(44 * S);
  const PADDLE_Y = H - Math.round(28 * S);
  const PADDLE_SPEED = Math.round(8 * S);
  const BRICK_COLORS = ["#f43f5e", "#f97316", "#eab308", "#22c55e", "#3b82f6"];

  let paddle,
    ball,
    bricks,
    score,
    lives,
    level,
    running = false,
    animId,
    demoAnimId;
  let bestScore = parseInt(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) || "0", 10);
  const keys = {};

  document.getElementById("best-score").textContent = bestScore;

  function ballSpeed(lvl) {
    const vx = (1.5 + lvl * 0.35) * S * (Math.random() > 0.5 ? 1 : -1);
    const vy = -(2.2 + lvl * 0.35) * S;
    return { vx, vy };
  }

  function createBricks() {
    const arr = [];
    for (let r = 0; r < BRICK_ROWS; r++)
      for (let c = 0; c < BRICK_COLS; c++)
        arr.push({
          x: BRICK_GAP + c * (BRICK_W + BRICK_GAP),
          y: BRICK_TOP + r * (BRICK_H + BRICK_GAP),
          w: BRICK_W,
          h: BRICK_H,
          color: BRICK_COLORS[r],
          alive: true,
          hits: r < 2 ? 2 : 1,
        });
    return arr;
  }

  function resetBall(lvl) {
    const spd = ballSpeed(lvl);
    ball = { x: W / 2, y: H - Math.round(50 * S), vx: spd.vx, vy: spd.vy };
    paddle.x = W / 2 - PADDLE_W / 2;
  }

  function startGame() {
    clearTimeout(demoAnimId);
    document.getElementById("demo-label").style.display = "none";
    level = 1;
    score = 0;
    lives = 3;
    paddle = { x: W / 2 - PADDLE_W / 2, y: PADDLE_Y };
    bricks = createBricks();
    resetBall(1);
    updateUI();
    document.getElementById("overlay").style.display = "none";
    running = true;
    cancelAnimationFrame(animId);
    animId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }

  function updateUI() {
    document.getElementById("score").textContent = score;
    document.getElementById("level").textContent = level;
    const livesEl = document.getElementById("lives");
    livesEl.innerHTML = Array.from({ length: lives }, () => '<span class="life">❤️</span>').join("") || "💀";
  }

  function loop() {
    if (!running) return;
    if (keys["ArrowLeft"]) paddle.x = Math.max(0, paddle.x - PADDLE_SPEED);
    if (keys["ArrowRight"]) paddle.x = Math.min(W - PADDLE_W, paddle.x + PADDLE_SPEED);
    update();
    draw();
    animId = requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }

  function update() {
    ball.x += ball.vx;
    ball.y += ball.vy;
    if (ball.x - BALL_R < 0) {
      ball.x = BALL_R;
      ball.vx = Math.abs(ball.vx);
    }
    if (ball.x + BALL_R > W) {
      ball.x = W - BALL_R;
      ball.vx = -Math.abs(ball.vx);
    }
    if (ball.y - BALL_R < 0) {
      ball.y = BALL_R;
      ball.vy = Math.abs(ball.vy);
    }
    if (ball.y + BALL_R > H) {
      lives--;
      if (lives <= 0) {
        showEnd("Game Over!");
        return;
      }
      updateUI();
      resetBall(level);
      return;
    }
    if (
      ball.y + BALL_R > paddle.y &&
      ball.y - BALL_R < paddle.y + PADDLE_H &&
      ball.x > paddle.x &&
      ball.x < paddle.x + PADDLE_W
    ) {
      ball.vy = -Math.abs(ball.vy);
      const rel = (ball.x - (paddle.x + PADDLE_W / 2)) / (PADDLE_W / 2);
      ball.vx = rel * 4 * S;
    }
    for (const b of bricks) {
      if (!b.alive) continue;
      if (
        ball.x + BALL_R > b.x &&
        ball.x - BALL_R < b.x + b.w &&
        ball.y + BALL_R > b.y &&
        ball.y - BALL_R < b.y + b.h
      ) {
        b.hits--;
        if (b.hits <= 0) {
          b.alive = false;
          score += 10 * level;
        }
        ball.vy *= -1;
        updateUI();
        break;
      }
    }
    if (bricks.every((b) => !b.alive)) {
      level++;
      if (level > 5) {
        showEnd("You Win! 🎉");
        return;
      }
      updateUI();
      bricks = createBricks();
      resetBall(level);
    }
  }

  function draw() {
    ctx.fillStyle = "#0f172a";
    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
    for (const b of bricks) {
      if (!b.alive) continue;
      ctx.fillStyle = b.hits > 1 ? b.color : b.color + "88";
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.roundRect(b.x, b.y, b.w, b.h, 3);
      ctx.fill();
    }
    ctx.fillStyle = "#7c3aed";
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.roundRect(paddle.x, paddle.y, PADDLE_W, PADDLE_H, 5);
    ctx.fill();
    ctx.fillStyle = "#f8fafc";
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.arc(ball.x, ball.y, BALL_R, 0, Math.PI * 2);
    ctx.fill();
  }

  function showEnd(msg) {
    running = false;
    cancelAnimationFrame(animId);
    if (score > bestScore) {
      bestScore = score;
      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, bestScore);
      document.getElementById("best-score").textContent = bestScore;
    }
    draw();
    const overlay = document.getElementById("overlay");
    document.getElementById("overlay-title").textContent = msg;
    document.getElementById("overlay-msg").textContent = `Score: ${score}`;
    overlay.querySelector("button").textContent = "Play Again";
    document.getElementById("demo-label").style.display = "none";
    overlay.style.display = "flex";
    startDemo();
  }

  // Demo: auto-track ball with paddle
  function startDemo() {
    paddle = { x: W / 2 - PADDLE_W / 2, y: PADDLE_Y };
    const spd = ballSpeed(1);
    ball = { x: W / 2, y: H / 2, vx: spd.vx * 0.7, vy: Math.abs(spd.vy) * 0.7 };
    bricks = createBricks();
    let demoScore = 0;

    function demoLoop() {
      // AI: smoothly track ball
      const target = ball.x - PADDLE_W / 2;
      const diff = target - paddle.x;
      paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W - PADDLE_W, paddle.x + diff * 0.12));

      ball.x += ball.vx;
      ball.y += ball.vy;
      if (ball.x - BALL_R < 0) {
        ball.x = BALL_R;
        ball.vx = Math.abs(ball.vx);
      }
      if (ball.x + BALL_R > W) {
        ball.x = W - BALL_R;
        ball.vx = -Math.abs(ball.vx);
      }
      if (ball.y - BALL_R < 0) {
        ball.y = BALL_R;
        ball.vy = Math.abs(ball.vy);
      }
      if (ball.y + BALL_R > H) {
        ball.y = H / 2;
        ball.vy = -Math.abs(ball.vy);
      }
      if (
        ball.y + BALL_R > paddle.y &&
        ball.y - BALL_R < paddle.y + PADDLE_H &&
        ball.x > paddle.x &&
        ball.x < paddle.x + PADDLE_W
      ) {
        ball.vy = -Math.abs(ball.vy);
        const rel = (ball.x - (paddle.x + PADDLE_W / 2)) / (PADDLE_W / 2);
        ball.vx = rel * 3 * S;
      }
      for (const b of bricks) {
        if (!b.alive) continue;
        if (
          ball.x + BALL_R > b.x &&
          ball.x - BALL_R < b.x + b.w &&
          ball.y + BALL_R > b.y &&
          ball.y - BALL_R < b.y + b.h
        ) {
          b.hits--;
          if (b.hits <= 0) b.alive = false;
          ball.vy *= -1;
          break;
        }
      }
      if (bricks.every((b) => !b.alive)) bricks = createBricks();
      draw();
      demoAnimId = requestAnimationFrame(demoLoop);
    }
    draw();
    demoAnimId = requestAnimationFrame(demoLoop);
  }

  // Mouse control
  canvas.addEventListener("mousemove", (e) => {
    if (!running) return;
    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
    const scaleX = W / rect.width;
    paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W - PADDLE_W, (e.clientX - rect.left) * scaleX - PADDLE_W / 2));
  });

  // Touch control (mobile drag)
  canvas.addEventListener(
    "touchstart",
    (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!running) return;
      const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
      const scaleX = W / rect.width;
      paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W - PADDLE_W, (e.touches[0].clientX - rect.left) * scaleX - PADDLE_W / 2));
    },
    { passive: false }
  );

  canvas.addEventListener(
    "touchmove",
    (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (!running) return;
      const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
      const scaleX = W / rect.width;
      paddle.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W - PADDLE_W, (e.touches[0].clientX - rect.left) * scaleX - PADDLE_W / 2));
    },
    { passive: false }
  );

  // Keyboard: track held keys for continuous movement
  document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
    if (e.key === "ArrowLeft" || e.key === "ArrowRight") e.preventDefault();
    keys[e.key] = true;
  });
  document.addEventListener("keyup", (e) => {
    delete keys[e.key];
  });

  // Start with demo
  ctx.fillStyle = "#0f172a";
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
  startDemo();
</script>
